{
  "description": "chain_uid (genesis block hash, NET-ALL-22) of live EVM chains, queried from public RPCs; each value matched on two sources unless noted. chain_uid alone is NOT unique (ETH/ETC, Avalanche/Fuji share genesis): a chain is (chainId, chain_uid).",
  "verified": "2026-10-08",
  "method": "eth_chainId + eth_getBlockByNumber(\"0x0\").hash",
  "privateNote": "NET-ALL-25: every row's `private` is true for a chain SCaaS runs (its genesis carries a unique extraData nonce and is in no other row; a chain repeating it under another chain id is refused), false for a public chain (public chains may share a genesis, told apart by chainId; no two rows share the pair (chainId, chainUid)).",
