  "otherKindsNote": "The kinds the deploy gate passes on a shared genesis: each digest they check binds the chain id, or none binds a chain (RescueVault, by design); spec 2026-11-21-avax-polkadot-arweave section 8.1. A kind name on neither list is KIND_UNKNOWN (review P3-1).",
  "homeChainKindsNote": "NET-ALL-25 (C18): the kinds that keep or check records bound to chain_uid without the chain id (homeChain records; UARegistry's UAMsigUpdate and UAPqzScopedKey / UAPqzScopedKeyRecord under the portable domain, review P1-2; the audit: spec 2026-11-21-avax-polkadot-arweave section 8.1); the deploy gate refuses them on a chain whose chainUid another row shares (script/deploybook.py kind_check, script/DeployBook.sol _requireKindHere). A later kind with such a record joins this list.",
